flowchart TD
    Pack[版本化设定包] --> Genesis[世界初态]
    Genesis --> Events[(追加事件日志)]
    Events --> State[(当前状态投影)]
    Events --> History[(历史索引与档案)]
    Events --> Snapshot[(检查点快照)]
    State --> Knowledge[按角色授权的知识投影]
    Knowledge --> Memory[全文与向量检索]
    Memory --> Prompt[受限模型上下文]
    Snapshot --> Branch[新分支]
    Events --> Branch
    Branch --> Events
